  "reviews": [
    {
      "author": "Sierbahnn",
      "content": "Of course this is murder-Groundhog day\r\nThe twist is nice, very reminiscent of old Twilight Zone, but before you get there you get Groundhog day, but with a serial killer.\r\n\r\nThe setup is enticing, the execution fun while flawed, but it makes it across the finish-line and it is a fun movie.\r\n\r\nAlso great fun to see Master Ken in a movie like this. He, like the rest of the cast, do their jobs well and you feel immersed in this oddball idea.",
      "rating": 6,
      "createdAt": "2026-06-16T15:16:47Z"
    }
